%% ===== A1: 启动 → 拷贝 → 运行时解析 → 加载 Monaco =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant Build as 构建脚本
    participant Pkg as electron-builder
    participant HTML as index.html
    participant EM as EditorManager.init()
    participant Loader as window.require (AMD)
    participant FS as 文件系统/asar

    Build->>Build: esbuild.renderer.mjs → dist/renderer/index.js
    Build->>Build: copy-monaco-assets.mjs → dist/renderer/vs(loader.js+editor.main+base/workers)
    Pkg->>FS: dist/**/* 进 asar
    Pkg->>FS: asarUnpack dist/renderer/vs → app.asar.unpacked/dist/renderer/vs (真实文件)

    HTML->>Loader: <script src="dist/renderer/vs/loader.js">
    Loader-->>HTML: 定义 window.require
    HTML->>EM: 打开文件 → init()

    EM->>EM: vsBase = new URL('dist/renderer/vs', document.baseURI).href
    EM->>EM: self.MonacoEnvironment.getWorkerUrl = blob(importScripts(vsBase+base/worker/workerMain.js))
    EM->>Loader: require.config({ paths: { vs: vsBase } })
    EM->>Loader: require(['vs/editor/editor.main'], cb, errCb)
    alt 加载成功
        Loader-->>EM: monaco 实例
        EM->>EM: createEditor() → resolve()
    else 加载失败
        Loader-->>EM: errCb(err)
        EM->>EM: showToast('编辑器加载失败，请重启应用','error')
        EM-->>EM: reject() 保留欢迎屏（不白屏）
    end

%% ===== A5: ai 经 bus 请求快照 → files responder 回传 =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant AI as ai/index.ts 或 ai/studio.ts
    participant Bus as bus
    participant FP as files/index.ts
    participant EM as EditorManager

    Note over FP,EM: initFilesPage 时注册 responder（一次）
    FP->>Bus: respond(RequestActiveFileSnapshot, () => editorManager.getActiveFileSnapshot())
    FP->>FP: window.__getActiveFileSnapshot = deprecated 壳 (warn 一次)

    AI->>Bus: request(RequestActiveFileSnapshot)
    Bus->>FP: 调用已注册 responder
    FP->>EM: getActiveFileSnapshot()
    EM-->>FP: { filePath, fileName, content, selection? } | null
    FP-->>Bus: 返回 snapshot
    Bus-->>AI: resolve(snapshot)
    AI->>AI: 据 snapshot 加入 pendingFiles / 渲染上下文中心

    Note over AI,FP: files/index.ts:494 同页自读 → 直接 editorManager.getActiveFileSnapshot()（不走 bus）
